# August 2026 – Monthly Development Report

During August 2026, development, integration, optimization, and maintenance activities were carried out across **four active projects: Paragon School, EVRYDAE, Monty Real Gems, and Anmol Sewa Foundation**. The work covered frontend development, API integrations, Shopify and Razorpay functionality, SEO improvements, responsive UI enhancements, e-commerce checkout workflows, and website performance/functionality improvements.

